# Large audio lives in Vercel Blob, not git (see docs/blob-migration.md).
# Beds, the voice cache, and voice previews are uploaded by the workflows;
# only the manifest (lib/voiceCacheManifest.json) is tracked.
/public/sounds/*.mp3
/public/sounds/**/*.mp3
/public/voice-cache/*.mp3
/public/voice-previews/*.mp3
# No audio belongs at the repo root.
/*.mp3
